   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Cory - I believe it should be possible to zoom in to a graph with brushing, if the data source is a reactive which can be modified by the brush. But presently zooming out and panning wouldn&#39;t be straightforward. We&#39;re planning on adding support for this in ggvis, though.<div>\r\n\r\n<br></div><div>-Winston</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
